    <h2 style="color: #0D529C; font-size: 22px; margin-top: 30px; font-weight: 700;">Our Mission &amp; Clinical Philosophy</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 16px;">
      Hearing loss is not simply a volume problem — it affects brain cognitive health, emotional connection, and quality of life. At AHCC, our philosophy is anchored on three clinical pillars:
    </p>

    <ul style="color: #334155; padding-left: 22px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;">
      <li><strong>Precision Diagnosis Before Device:</strong> We never sell hearing devices over the counter. Every client undergoes rigorous audiometric evaluation in an ISO-calibrated soundproof booth.</li>
      <li><strong>Certified Technology:</strong> As an authorized partner of Swiss Sonova (Phonak) and leading German/Danish brands, we guarantee 100% genuine hardware with international warranty support.</li>
      <li><strong>Continuous Rehabilitation:</strong> Hearing adaptation takes time. We provide free follow-up fine-tuning sessions, regular cleaning, and auditory counselling for the lifetime of your device.</li>
    </ul>

